OL,3,AHuntingdon train attacker found guilty
OL,4,Aof all 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthony Williams has been found guilty
OL,7,Fof all 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,9,FWilliams, 33, attacked 10 people on an
OL,10,FLNER train from Peterborough to London
OL,11,Fon 1 November last year
OL,13,FHe denied 14 counts of attempted murder
OL,14,Fin total, including attacks away from
OL,15,Fthe train, in Peterborough and London
OL,17,FThe jury initially found Williams
OL,18,Fguilty of seven counts - but had yet to
OL,19,Freach verdicts on the remaining seven
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
