OL,3,AMandelson kept lobby firm shares for
OL,4,Amonths as ambassador, despite conflict
OL,5,Aof interest fears
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe documents show senior officials
OL,8,Fwere concerned about potential
OL,9,Fconflicts of interest from Mandelson's
OL,10,Fshareholding
OL,12,FPM Andy Burnham says the culture in
OL,13,FWestminster that gave rise to the
OL,14,Fscandal surrounding Mandelson's
OL,15,Fappointment has not changed enough
OL,17,FIn the UK, police are investigating
OL,18,Fallegations that Mandelson, while
OL,19,Fserving as a minister, passed on
OL,20,Fmarket-sensitive information to the
OL,21,Flate convicted sex offender Jeffrey
OL,22,FEpstein
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
